{"id":"42a23ade1ce9e8e9","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-ext.md","title":"可计算全延伸的索引集","display":"df-ext — 可计算全延伸的索引集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-ext","aliases":["20-df-ext"],"display":"df-ext — 可计算全延伸的索引集","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 1.6.15","source_pdf_pages":[53],"source_printed_pages":[17],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-partial-function]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-ext"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-ext</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ext — 可计算全延伸的索引集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.6.15"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；函数包含表示图的集合包含。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ext}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}:=\\{e:\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\varphi_e\\subseteq f]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ext}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}:=\\{e:\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\varphi_e\\subseteq f]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Ext 的 extendible 指部分数值函数有可计算全延伸；树节点的可延伸性是另一概念。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.6.15；印刷页 17；PDF 第 53 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ext}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}:=\\{e:\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\varphi_e\\subseteq f]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1209,"backlinks":[{"id":"d9aaf109dea18156","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]；see [[20-df-ext]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。"},{"id":"1028296e1af7c37c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ext]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]；see [[20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal]]；see [[20-df-rel-arith]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"}],"outgoing":["dc642dd12c05d028","3f7915f8f8ad037c","e343870c773cb6